{"unit_id":"Juryorca__dsh-custom-theme-import#card-zh","repo":"Juryorca/dsh-custom-theme-import","commit":"b77585d24385302bf243251df6f7b1d9a9cf5703","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-theme-import 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的主题管理插件，在设置页加入“我的主题”面板。它通过主机端接口维护主题库，并加载所选主题的客户端模块。主要功能包括从本地路径添加主题、从 GitHub 导入主题集合、扫描已安装皮肤、预览和切换主题，以及删除和刷新主题列表；本地主题可选择复制到托管目录。适合想集中管理 DSH Web 外观、试用或切换皮肤的用户。无需额外 API 密钥；主题库保存在本机的 DSH 数据目录中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:20-20","lib/index.js:454-515","lib/client.js:455-460","lib/client.js:400-450"]}
{"unit_id":"Juryorca__dsh-custom-theme-import#card-en","repo":"Juryorca/dsh-custom-theme-import","commit":"b77585d24385302bf243251df6f7b1d9a9cf5703","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-custom-theme-import manages themes in DSH Web settings. It adds a My Themes panel for local and GitHub imports, installed-skin scanning, previewing, switching, and deleting themes. Local themes may be copied into managed storage. The library stays on the host; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:20-20","lib/index.js:454-515","lib/client.js:455-460","lib/client.js:400-450"]}
